{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail on a journey of light and discovery with the <i>Monument Valley 3</i>\u00a0Original Soundtrack - a tranquil, immersive score composed by <strong>Todd Baker</strong> and <strong>Lucie Treacher</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring <strong>39 original tracks</strong> and over <strong>1 hour and 35 minutes</strong> of music, this album accompanies Noor\u2019s voyage through the breath-taking landscapes of <i>Monument Valley 3</i>. Whether you\u2019re revisiting the emotional arc of the game or simply seeking a moment of calm in your day, this soundtrack offers a space to pause, reflect, and breathe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally released on July 1st, 2025, the <i>Monument Valley 3</i> (Original Game Soundtrack) is a companion piece to one of the most ambitious entries in the series - inviting you to reconnect with the beauty, stillness, and wonder of the Monument Valley world.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3846460?t=1755522921","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3846460?t=1755522921","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846460/59448d7e643a0db90ae0ea4e258e2c9dac47ea25/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755522921","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846460/59448d7e643a0db90ae0ea4e258e2c9dac47ea25/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755522921","categories":[{"description":"Additional High-Quality Audio","id":50}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail on a journey of light and discovery with the <i>Monument Valley 3</i>\u00a0Original Soundtrack - a tranquil, immersive score composed by <strong>Todd Baker</strong> and <strong>Lucie Treacher</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=